  "acquisition_note": "Transcribed, not generated. Plan 5.1's correction makes acquisition a property of a corpus rather than of a project, and TMIW's Precor test is a literal TestPair list with no Random() call, so its packets and expectations transcribe directly -- the same situation as the four RSC corpora. Extracted mechanically by script from the Dart source rather than retyped, then every case was re-derived independently from the byte offsets in plan 5b and compared field by field against TMIW's asserted values; all ten agree exactly. No value here was typed by hand, which is what plan 5.1's correction asks transcription to mean in practice.",
