  "note": "Fixed-layout proprietary frame with no flag word: identity is the three-octet prefix 53 59 16 and every field sits at a known offset. Cadence is uint16 LE at 8-9 divided by 10, which is divergence V10 -- QZ's chronobike reads byte 8 alone divided by 2 and discards byte 9. Eight of these ten cases carry a non-zero byte 9, and in all ten it equals the high octet of cadence x 10, which is the evidence that resolved V10 in TMIW's favour. Bytes 15-16 are decoded but published as no metric; calories divided by that value is 1.19-1.21 across every case, the shape of a cumulative work total in kJ, and one source with no ground truth is not enough to ship a field on. Adversarial cases -- truncation, corrupted prefix, saturated uint16 -- are FitBridge-authored and live in PrecorMeasurementTest rather than here.",
